        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r3" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;c64ca5d and nine sibling commits: all 52 jobs in 10 repositories move to runs-on: mk4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#334155&quot;&gt;Runner group Default now allows public repositories. In the next hour 29 jobs run on mk4: 7 pass, 22 fail.&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;rounded=1;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
