        <mxCell id="r5" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;18b905c: our own image ghcr.io/mrjithendar/mk4-runner, built on a GitHub-hosted arm64 runner&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#334155&quot;&gt;git-lfs, Python, build-essential, shellcheck, gh, kubectl, helm... Helm revision 2 of arc-runners at 06:35.&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0fdfa;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;rounded=1;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
